# The build context of a container recipe is the repository root, so this file
# guards it: nothing enters the context but what scripts/release/stage-dist.sh
# and the release lane stage under dist/. A checkout carrying a target/
# directory would otherwise send gigabytes to the builder.
*
!dist/
